# Shared look of every documentation GIF; each tape starts with
# `Source _settings.tape` (render.sh copies this file next to the tape run).
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 640
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Builtin Tango Dark"
Set TypingSpeed 50ms
Set CursorBlink false

Hide
Type "source ~/.bashrc && clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
